(20,2,'Nuestras Voces','Fundación Grupo Social ha hecho suyos los sueños, ilusiones y proyectos de millones de colombianos, contribuyendo de forma concreta a hacerlos realidad. Servir a la sociedad, especialmente a quienes más lo necesitan, es su única razón de existir y para ello trabaja desde hace más de un siglo.','<section class=\"page_title_section quienes_somos position-relative\">\r\n<div class=\"d-flex\">\r\n<div class=\"width50 bg_white d-none-767 d-none-991\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"width50 width100_767 width100_991 background_image\">\r\n<div class=\"height_widht_over\"><img class=\"object_fit_cover\" src=\"https://fundaciongruposocial.co//storage/pages/May2019/fundacion-grupo-social-banner-nuestras-voces-1.jpg\" width=\"880\" height=\"300\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"position-absolute position-center\">\r\n<div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n<div class=\"left_right_padding_80\">\r\n<div class=\"title_box background_size position-relative oswaldfonts\">\r\n<div class=\"height_widht_over d-none-991\"><img class=\"object_fit_cover\" src=\"https://fundaciongruposocial.co//storage/pages/May2019/fundacion-grupo-social-banner-nuestras-voces-2_1.jpg\" width=\"858\" height=\"178\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"position-absolute position-center  z-index-9\">\r\n<h1>Nuestras Voces</h1>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"title_under_line position-absolute position-center d-none-767 d-none-991\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n<div class=\"left_right_padding_80\"><nav class=\"breadcrumb position-absolute robotfonts\"><a class=\"breadcrumb-item\" href=\"/admin/pages/20/\">Inicio</a> <span class=\"breadcrumb-item active\">Nuestras Voces</span></nav></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"actuamos section_one_quie bg_white\">\r\n<div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n<div class=\"inner_text left_right_padding_80\">\r\n<div class=\"max_width robotfonts mt-5 mb-5\">\r\n<p class=\"robotfonts text-left\">